          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: The gendarmerie is informed via the press that various individuals have observed a luminous phenomenon in the sky on several consecutive occasions. Witness descriptions vary as to the very nature of the phenomenon (ball or light, with or without flashing, moving or stationary), (white and red) and some details are unclear. The air surveillance services at Base 105 in Evreux-Fauville noted no unusual phenomena in the sky on October 28, 1977. The gendarmerie collected no further testimony regarding this phenomenon. These people likely made an astronomical observation.",
